			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Includes 9,057 Common Shares still subject to vesting as of January 23, 2026.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 27pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
