			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Includes 9,057 Common Shares still subject to vesting as of January 23, 2026. The Common Shares owned by Mr. Nygren include 10,888 Common Shares purchased in open-market transactions at various times. All of Mr. Nygren&#8217;s shares are held jointly with his wife, who shares voting and investment power as to those shares.</p>
			</td>
