			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Lightera, LLC (&#8220;Lightera&#8221;) is located at 2000 NE Expressway, Norcross, Georgia 30071. OCC and Lightera entered into a Stock Purchase Agreement effective July 7, 2025 under which OCC issued 642,199 redeemable restricted shares of its common stock to Lightera.</p>
