			<td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 30%;">
			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt;">Chairman of the Board,</p>
