			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(2)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">These amounts represent insurance premiums and medical benefits paid or accrued by the Company on behalf of the individual executive officers, the Company&#8217;s paid or accrued contributions to the Company&#8217;s 401(k) retirement savings plan on behalf of the individual executive officers during the fiscal year and the Company&#8217;s paid or accrued contributions to the individual executive officers&#8217;&#160;health savings plans during the fiscal year. The benefits paid to the executive officers which are included as &#8220;All Other Compensation&#8221;&#160;in the table above are the same benefits available to all eligible employees under the Company&#8217;s employee benefit plans.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

