			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">(2) The dollar amounts reported represent the amounts of &#8220;compensation actually paid&#8221;&#160;to our PEO, Neil D. Wilkin, Jr., as computed in accordance with Item 402(v) of Regulation S-K, for each covered year. See table below.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td colspan="7" style="vertical-align: middle; width: auto; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td>
		</tr>
