			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Non-binding advisory vote to approve named executive officer compensation.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:5.7%;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:4.9%;">&#160;</td>
