			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:26.2%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>FOR</b>&#160;this proposal</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:5.2%;">
			<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9744;</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:28.9%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>AGAINST</b>&#160;this proposal</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:5.4%;">
			<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9744;</p>
			</td>
